PowerPlant_Interior1_Text_Policeman_1::
	.string "A thief broke into the POWER PLANT…\p"
	.string "What is the world coming to?$"

PowerPlant_Interior1_Text_Policeman_2::
	.string "We’ll have to beef up our security\n"
	.string "presence.$"

PowerPlant_Interior1_Text_Scientist_1::
	.string "This POWER PLANT had been abandoned\n"
	.string "in the past.\p"
	.string "We got it back up and running to\n"
	.string "provide power to the MAGNET TRAIN.$"

PowerPlant_Interior1_Text_Scientist_2::
	.string "The generator’s running again!$"

PowerPlant_Interior1_Text_Scientist2_1::
	.string "Someone made off with a part that’s\n"
	.string "essential for the generator.\p"
	.string "Without it, the new generator’s\n"
	.string "useless!$"

PowerPlant_Interior1_Text_Scientist2_2::
	.string "The generator’s up and running. It’s\n"
	.string "making electricity to spare.$"

PowerPlant_Interior1_Text_Scientist3_1::
	.string "The MAGNET TRAIN consumes a lot of\n"
	.string "electricity.\p"
	.string "It can’t move if the new generator\n"
	.string "isn’t operating.$"

PowerPlant_Interior1_Text_Scientist3_2::
	.string "All right! We can finally get the\n"
	.string "MAGNET TRAIN running again.$"

PowerPlant_Interior1_Text_Policeman2_1::
	.string "The POWER PLANT’s MANAGER is up\n"
	.string "ahead.\p"
	.string "But since someone wrecked the\n"
	.string "generator, he’s been both sad and\l"
	.string "furious...$"

PowerPlant_Interior1_Text_Policeman2_2::
	.string "Since the generator’s been fixed,\n"
	.string "the MANAGER has been cheerful.$"

PowerPlant_Interior1_Text_BaldingMan_1::
	.string "MANAGER: I, I, I’m ready to blast\n"
	.string "someone!\p"
	.string "Who would dare ruin my generator?\p"
	.string "I spent so much time on it!\p"
	.string "If I catch him, he’s going to get\n"
	.string "a taste of my ZAP CANNON!$"

PowerPlant_Interior1_Text_BaldingMan_2::
	.string "MANAGER: My beloved generator!\n"
	.string "Keep pumping the electricity out!$"

PowerPlant_Interior1_Text_BaldingMan_3::
	.string "MANAGER: Ah! Yeah!\p"
	.string "That’s the missing PART from my\n"
	.string "beloved generator!\l"
	.string "You found it?\p"
	.string "Wahah! Thanks!\p"
	.string "Here! Take this TM as a reward!$"

PowerPlant_Interior1_Text_BaldingMan_4::
	.string "MANAGER: TM07 is my ZAP CANNON.\n"
	.string "It’s a powerful technique!\p"
	.string "It’s not what anyone would consider\n"
	.string "accurate, but it packs a wallop!$"

PowerPlant_Interior1_Text_BaldingMan_5::
	.string "MANAGER: I won’t forgive him!\p"
	.string "The culprit can cry and apologize,\n"
	.string "but I’ll still hammer him!\p"
	.string "Gahahahah!$"

PowerPlant_Interior1_Text_PhoneCall_1::
	.string "I just got word from CERULEAN.\p"
	.string "It appears that a shady character\n"
	.string "has been loitering around.$"

PowerPlant_Interior1_Text_PhoneCall_2::
	.string "Could I ask for your cooperation?$"
